  "bodyHash": "ewUzLH5y0ws=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/xjC9jPx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"813\" height=\"97\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>最近有什麼新動向？（我已停止模組開發）</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>由於大學學業、工作及個人事務繁忙，過去幾個月我實在無法抽出時間更新模組，甚至連回答問題和私人訊息都難以顧及，因此我認為現階段最好先暫停模組開發。</strong></p>\n<p>這也代表短期內我不會將此模組更新至較新的 Minecraft 版本。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果有人對原始碼感興趣，我（終於...）把所有內容都放到 GitHub 上了（請見原始碼來源）。</p>\n<p>歡迎自由延續此模組，或將其整合到任何你想要的作品中。如有任何疑問，請隨時聯絡我！</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">若你在尋找此模組的 1.14+ 版本，請前往 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/food-expansion-reimagined\" rel=\"nofollow\">Food Expansion: Reimagined</a></span>，由 <span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/raulsmartin/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">raulsmartin</a></span> 製作。</span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Food Expansion 是個簡單的模組，為遊戲添加了新的食物。模組以原版食物為基礎，致力於強化食物系統。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>目前新增物品：</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>培根與脆培根：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>培根</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>脆培根</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>培根可由生豬肉合成，並可在熔爐中烤成脆培根。培根和脆培根進食速度比一般食物更快（16 tick 而非 32 tick）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/YDQd9Xl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"346\" height=\"331\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>煎蛋：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>煎蛋</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>煎蛋可透過在熔爐中烤普通雞蛋獲得，沒有其他附加效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/plddS29.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"346\" height=\"331\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>培根蛋：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>培根蛋</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>培根蛋可透過在工作台組合脆培根與煎蛋合成，沒有其他附加效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/QMlQBOo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"167\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>仙人掌果：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>仙人掌果</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>仙人掌果可透過在工作台放入 1 個仙人掌合成，沒有其他附加效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Ojlo7Sc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"365\" height=\"314\"></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>綠色果凍：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>綠色果凍</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>綠色果凍可透過將 4 個史萊姆球與 1 個糖合成。食用後有 100% 機率獲得 10 秒的噁心效果。綠色果凍進食速度比一般食物慢（64 tick 而非 32 tick）。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/tz5zz4i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"167\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>巧克力棒：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>巧克力棒</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>巧克力棒可透過將 2 個可可豆與 1 桶牛奶及 2 個糖合成，沒有其他附加效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/G0QPlix.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"368\" height=\"173\"></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>壓縮腐肉：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>壓縮腐肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>壓縮腐肉可透過將 4 個腐肉與 1 個糖合成。它與普通腐肉擁有相同的食物點數和飽和度，但不會造成飢餓效果。<strong>壓縮腐肉也可在熔爐中烤成皮革</strong>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/vnzARBn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"167\"></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>烤蘑菇：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>烤蘑菇</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>將 1 個蘑菇（紅色或棕色）放入熔爐即可烤成烤蘑菇，沒有其他附加效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Eq5RaEU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"167\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>胡蘿蔔派：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>胡蘿蔔派</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>胡蘿蔔派可透過在工作台使用 1 個胡蘿蔔、1 個小麥和 1 個雞蛋合成，沒有其他附加效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/NJwIUbf.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"309\"></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>胡蘿蔔湯：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>胡蘿蔔湯</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;（1.7.10）/ <img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\">&nbsp;（1.8.9+）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>胡蘿蔔湯可透過在工作台使用 2 個胡蘿蔔和 1 個碗合成，沒有其他附加效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/rXRuabp.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"366\" height=\"255\"></p>\n</div><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>蜘蛛眼燉湯：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>蜘蛛眼燉湯</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>蜘蛛眼燉湯可透過將 1 個碗、1 個蜘蛛眼和 1 個發酵蜘蛛眼合成。食用後會獲得 4 秒的中毒效果（類似原版蜘蛛眼），但也會獲得 15 秒的夜視藥水效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/fhT1U3o.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"174\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>地獄疙瘩燉湯：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>地獄疙瘩燉湯</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>地獄疙瘩燉湯可透過將 1 個碗、1 個糖和 2 個地獄疙瘩合成。食用後會著火，但會移除所有<strong>負面</strong>藥水效果。此物品比牛奶更有用，因為牛奶會同時移除正面和負面藥水效果，而地獄疙瘩燉湯只移除負面效果。<del>（不適用於其他模組的負面藥水效果）</del> <strong>1.12+ 版本已修復</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/MZygkUb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"392\" height=\"184\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>烈焰粉湯：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>烈焰粉湯</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>烈焰粉湯可透過將 1 個碗、1 桶牛奶和 2 個烈焰粉合成。食用後會獲得 15 秒的抗火效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/cGjk3AK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"402\" height=\"208\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>麵團</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>麵團</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<strong>&nbsp;/</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>麵團是此模組唯一不能食用的物品（畢竟生麵團不好吃）。但麵團可以讓獲得麵包更簡單：將 8 個小麥圍繞 1 桶水擺放，然後將產物放入熔爐烤熟即可獲得麵包。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/KE9Yifk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"317\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/z1ije33.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"369\" height=\"317\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>西瓜沙拉</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>西瓜沙拉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>西瓜沙拉可透過將 3 個西瓜與 1 個碗在工作台合成，沒有其他附加效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/ff1qV0D.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"397\" height=\"188\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>烤種子</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>烤種子</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>烤種子是遊戲初期獲取食物的簡單方式。只需將一些種子（支援小麥、西瓜、甜菜根（1.12+）及南瓜種子）放入熔爐烤熟即可享用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/eFMOZIq.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"370\" height=\"319\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>棒棒糖</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>棒棒糖</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>用 1 根木棒和 4 個糖合成棒棒糖。如果你有大量甘蔗，這是個實用的食物來源。由於棒棒糖非常堅硬，也可用作近戰武器，每次攻擊造成 3 點傷害。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/9AygOm7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"417\" height=\"203\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>禁果 / 飢餓果實</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>禁果</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>飢餓果</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：/</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>禁果和飢餓果是創造模式物品，無法透過合成獲得。但可在設定中開啟配方選項（分別使用8個附魔金蘋果/腐肉和1個鑽石方塊）。若對禁果按右鍵，會立即填滿飽食度；對飢餓果按右鍵，則會立即清空飽食度。兩者皆可無限次使用。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>甜菜根麵條</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>甜菜根麵條可用2個甜菜根、1桶水、1個小麥和1個碗合成。沒有任何額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/8pNNqeU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"392\" height=\"183\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組還新增了9種生物掉落物。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>羊肉（僅限1.7.10）：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>生羊肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>烤羊肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>羊肉可透過殺死羊獲得。每隻羊會掉落1-2個羊肉。羊肉可放入熔爐烤成熟羊肉。兩者皆無額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/TdJkfyB.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"346\" height=\"331\"></p>\n<p>（材質來自Minecraft原版1.8）</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>馬肉：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>生馬肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>烤馬肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>馬肉可透過殺死馬獲得。每匹馬會掉落1-3個馬肉。馬肉可放入熔爐烤成熟馬肉。兩者皆無額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/6l2MREm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"346\" height=\"331\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>魷魚：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>生魷魚</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>烤魷魚</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>魷魚可透過殺死魷魚獲得。每隻魷魚會掉落1-3個魷魚。魷魚可放入熔爐烤成熟魷魚。兩者皆無額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/WYY3eEU.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"346\" height=\"331\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>蝙蝠翅膀：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>生蝙蝠翅膀</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>烤蝙蝠翅膀</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>蝙蝠翅膀可透過殺死蝙蝠獲得。每隻蝙蝠固定掉落1個蝙蝠翅膀。蝙蝠翅膀可放入熔爐烤成熟蝙蝠翅膀。</p>\n<p>生吃蝙蝠翅膀有50%機率獲得20秒的飢餓藥水效果。烤過的版本則將此機率降低至10%。</p>\n<p>蝙蝠翅膀也可以與一些骨粉合成為皮革。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/qNIAOgL.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"346\" height=\"331\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>狼肉：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>生狼肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>烤狼肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>狼肉可透過殺死狼獲得。每隻狼會掉落1-3個狼肉。狼肉可放入熔爐烤成熟狼肉。兩者皆無額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/wMAqzK7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"354\" height=\"206\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>豹貓肉：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>豹貓肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>烤豹貓肉</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>豹貓肉可透過殺死豹貓獲得。每隻豹貓會掉落1-3個豹貓肉。豹貓肉可放入熔爐烤成熟豹貓肉。兩者皆無額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/zE9yTOw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"319\" height=\"186\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>鸚鵡肉：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>生鸚鵡肉：</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>烤鸚鵡肉：</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>鸚鵡肉由鸚鵡掉落，總是掉落1個。鸚鵡肉可放入熔爐烤成熟鸚鵡肉。兩者皆無額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/gMueqo1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"420\" height=\"168\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>羊駝肉：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>生羊駝肉：</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>羊駝排：</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>羊駝肉由羊駝掉落，每隻掉落1-2個。羊駝肉可放入熔爐烤成羊駝排。兩者皆無額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/WuV7mgZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"410\" height=\"165\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>北極熊肉：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>生北極熊肉：</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/7/72/Half_Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>北極熊排：</strong></p>\n<p>食物點數：<img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"><img src=\"http://hydra-media.cursecdn.com/minecraft.gamepedia.com/6/65/Hunger.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"17\" height=\"18\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>北極熊肉由北極熊掉落，每隻掉落1-3個。北極熊肉可放入熔爐烤成北極熊排。兩者皆無額外效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/Pn1FDKF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"413\" height=\"166\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組還將所有原版和食物擴展模組中食用後會返還碗的食物堆疊數量提升至64個。這樣就不再需要佔用太多背包空間了。（1.3+）</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>安裝教學（由<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCI-2mseG0b3Y72iWP6xkHvw\" rel=\"nofollow\">King's Tutorials</a>提供）</strong></p><p><strong><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3ECybPVsg7A?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>模組評論：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>非常感謝各位！:)</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>你的評論沒有列在這裡嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>請別猶豫，直接發送私訊或留言給我！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCP8r5Mhz18i7ACfpsz-nSew\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pixel wolf Gaming</a></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HWbY3MmJoBw?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwWsDR0ns7sxaubQQNv6Ptg\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zinconix35</a></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9NUjgosOOso?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>by <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbdRzJfVRe2f8GdK8XpDLLg\" rel=\"nofollow\">LessMrFoot (FootLess)</a></p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5K2HnD_jko8?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>歡迎在我的模組包中使用我的模組！</strong></p>",
